IMAPAccount posteo
Host posteo.de
User enas@posteo.com
PassCmd "security find-generic-password -a enas@posteo.com -s mbsync -w"
AuthMechs LOGIN
TLSType IMAPS
TLSVersions +1.3

IMAPStore posteo-remote
Account posteo

MaildirStore posteo-local
Path ~/mail/posteo/
Inbox ~/mail/posteo/Inbox
Subfolders Verbatim

Channel posteo
Far :posteo-remote:
Near :posteo-local:
Create Both
Expunge Both
Patterns *
SyncState *
